# deslop-please findings judged right to keep, one reason above each. Debt to be fixed is not listed here.
# Check with: deslop-please --allow .deslop-please.allow
# Revoked execs are an outbox: HostAuthority drains it so the relay cancels them outside the authority lock (no waits under it).
field-leak wssp::sandbox_relay::authority::AuthorityState::revoked_execs
# The carry policy's effect-gate backstop, set once when the expiry service starts; the gate falls back to the default before that.
field-leak wssp::sandbox_relay::authority::AuthorityState::effect_gate_max_wait
